"""Mutation testing of the GUI (wbclient/gui.py and the page's JavaScript): break the code on purpose, the named pytest tests must fail.
Usage: python3 tools/mutate_gui.py [part of a label]     (needs build/wb_sim, build/ui_reference, node, pytest, playwright + Chromium)
A mutant that is listed as SURVIVED means a test is missing or too weak. Every file is restored afterwards.
env WB_LABELS=file runs exactly the mutants whose labels are listed in that file. A kill by a timeout is run twice (FLAKY if the second run passes)."""
